# ---- the render path's ports ----------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-08-31. zhao_shell_top gained 40 ports when the render client was
# wired onto client_req[2], and this list did not follow. Without them Quartus
# treats each as a real pad: the fitter reported 742 IO input pads against 315
# available on the 5CSEBA6U23I7 and refused the design. They are wires in the
# composed machine, not pins, exactly like the 101 already here.
#
# THE WILDCARD IS STILL FORBIDDEN. `-to *` matched every internal net and drove
# the map to 28.4 GB (see the header). These are named explicitly for the same
# reason the first 101 are.
